WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.627
Foundation models have transformed language and
vision, yet tabular data,

00:00:04.707 --> 00:00:07.658
the workhorse of data science, was left behind.

00:00:07.738 --> 00:00:09.915
Every table has a different schema,

00:00:09.995 --> 00:00:13.397
so a model trained on one rarely transfers to another.

00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:15.332
This paper introduces UniTabE,

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:19.588
a universal pretraining protocol that handles any
table uniformly.

00:00:19.668 --> 00:00:23.199
It encodes each cell with a small module called TabUnit,

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:27.713
refines the table with a Transformer, and adapts
through text prompts.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:31.840
Pretrained on thirteen billion Kaggle samples, it
beats XGBoost.
